<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
:root { --ink:#1f2430; --muted:#6b7280; --line:#d8dee9; --bg:#fbfbfd; --accent:#2b6cb0; --warn:#fff3bf; }
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin:0; padding:0 16px 56px; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);
  font:16px/1.78 -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif; }
.page { max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; }
header.page { padding:40px 0 10px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--line); }
h1 { font-size:26px; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 10px; letter-spacing:.5px; }
h2 { font-size:19px; margin:0 0 12px; padding-left:10px; border-left:4px solid var(--accent); }
h3 { font-size:15px; margin:18px 0 6px; color:var(--muted); }
p { margin:8px 0; }
p.src, p.note, p.muted, p.scope { color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; }
p.scope { background:#eef2f7; border-radius:6px; padding:6px 10px; }
p.card-path { font-family:ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; font-size:14px; margin:0 0 4px; }
p.removed { font-size:13px; color:#a1222e; background:#fde8e8; border-radius:4px; padding:4px 8px; }
.badge { display:inline-block; padding:2px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-size:13px;
  background:#e8f0fe; color:#1a4d8f; }
.badge.model { background:#fde8e8; color:#a1222e; }
.untraced-count { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin-left:8px; }
.untraced-count.warn { color:#8a5a00; background:var(--warn); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; }
.untraced-count.ok { color:#2f7d32; }
main { padding-top:4px; }
section.blk { margin:34px 0 0; scroll-margin-top:12px; }
ul.plain, ul.tree { margin:8px 0; padding-left:20px; }
ul.metrics { list-style:none; margin:10px 0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
ul.metrics li { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; padding:4px 10px; background:#fff; }
ul.metrics .k { color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; margin-right:8px; }
ul.metrics .v { font-weight:600; }
ul.tree code { font-size:13px; }
div.card { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:10px 14px; background:#fff; margin:12px 0; }
details { margin:10px 0; }
summary { cursor:pointer; color:var(--accent); font-size:14px; }
table.grid { border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:13px; margin:8px 0; }
table.grid th, table.grid td { border:1px solid var(--line); padding:4px 8px; text-align:left;
  vertical-align:top; }
table.grid th { background:#eef2f7; font-weight:600; }
table.grid tr:nth-child(even) td { background:#fafbfd; }
pre.code { overflow-x:auto; background:#1f2430; color:#e6e6e6; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:6px;
  font:13px/1.55 ui-monospace, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace; }
pre.code .ln { color:#7f8c9b; }
mark.untraced { background:var(--warn); padding:0 2px; border-radius:2px; }
svg.graph, figure.graph { max-width:100%; display:block; margin:12px 0; }
svg.graph { height:auto; }
figure.graph { margin:12px 0; }
.prose code { background:#eef2f7; border-radius:3px; padding:1px 4px; font-size:13px; }
footer.page { margin-top:44px; padding-top:14px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="page">
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  <p><span class="badge {{ mode }}">{{ badge }}</span>
    <span class="untraced-count {{ 'ok' if untraced == 0 else 'warn' }}">本页有 {{ untraced }} 处数字未溯源</span></p>
  <p class="src">仓库 {{ repo_url }} · commit {{ commit }} · 主语言 {{ language }} · 生成于 {{ created_at }} · 由 {{ tool_name }} {{ tool_version }} 生成</p>
</header>
<main>
{%- for section in sections %}
  <section class="blk" data-component="{{ section.component }}">
    <h2>{{ section.title }}</h2>
    {{ section.html | safe }}
  </section>
{%- endfor %}
</main>
<footer class="page src">
  <p>统计口径为 listing 计数，符号链接内容未计入。</p>
  <p>目录被剪枝时，其中的文件只按 listing 计数，不会进入 files 列表。</p>
  <p>本页是单文件离线页：零脚本、零外链，样式全部内联，唯一的 xmlns 命名空间串由 SVG 自身携带。</p>
{%- if rescanned %}
  <p>本页数据来自本次重扫（目录里没有 repo.json）</p>
{%- endif %}
</footer>
</body>
</html>
